invariant: INV-17
file: tls.c
catches: unit
reason: the read key survives the peer's close_notify, although nothing is
  read after it, so SRAM holds a live key for the rest of the session.

--- old
static void close_read_side(ch_tls *t) {
    ct_wipe(&t->rd, sizeof t->rd);
--- new
